=== On BBB:
sudo nano /etc/modprobe.d/g_ether.conf
options g_ether dev_addr=02:bb:bb:00:00:01 host_addr=02:bb:bb:00:00:02
(02:bb:bb:00:00:01 is MAC of BBB, 02:bb:bb:00:00:02 is MAC on PC -> enx02bbbb000002)
	+ cat /sys/module/g_ether/parameters/dev_addr -> 02:bb:bb:00:00:01
	+ cat /sys/module/g_ether/parameters/host_addr -> 02:bb:bb:00:00:02

// Ensure the kernel recognizes the new options
sudo depmod -a

// reboot

=== On PC:
sudo nano /etc/udev/rules.d/70-persistent-net.rules
SUBSYSTEM=="net", ACTION=="add", ATTR{address}=="02:bb:bb:00:00:02", NAME="usb0"
(If enx02bbbb000002 is matched -> assign usb0)

sudo udevadm control --reload-rules
sudo udevadm trigger
